[{:adr/addendum-2026-07-12-migration-landed "実移行完了(同日、PR #148、main d4f648d、本番デプロイ済み): index.htmlの<style>420→115行(compound-selector上書き・--pop-*・手発明hex・手書きlayout全削除)、views.cljsはkotoba-ui.core+uikit.coreのみrequire(glass-text-field/text-areaフォークとruntime CSS注入をretire、layout=ui/app-shell/hero/section/grid/stack、px font-size→.hig-*)、themeはnbb build-time静的生成(public/css/theme.css 600行、accent #FF3CAC/dark)。検証: lint 0/0・bb gates 10/10・cljs 137/137・CI green・実Chromium 19/19(320px全タブscrollWidth==320、nav tab contrast 6.49:1、5ms/char typingで喪失ゼロ)。west pin 07f43990。注記: Playwright headless shellはRAF絞りでkeystroke偽陽性→E2Eは実Chromium必須。" :adr/addendum-2026-07-12 "ADR-2607122200の上流整備により本ADRのCSS戦術群は陳腐化予定: compound-selector上書きは@layer格納(app unlayered常勝)で構造的に不要化、lg/text-field keystroke喪失バグは上流根治(:value+:on-input がreagent controlled-input安全機構を外すのが根本原因。liquid-glass-ui PR #3)でglass-text-field/glass-text-areaフォークは移行時retire可、hex直書きはshitsuke.hig tokens+kotoba-ui.theme(accent 1 map)で置換可能。実移行(412行インラインCSS解体→shell/theme載せ替え)はADR-2607122200 D7のfollow-upとして未着手。着手時はkotoba-ui/docs/agent-guide.mdを正典とする。" :db/id -1
  :adr/id "adr-2607101000-net-babiniku-zeta-ai-uiux-redesign"
  :adr/doc_type "adr"
  :adr/title "ADR-2607101000: net-babiniku -- zeta-ai-modeled UI/UX redesign (web) + mobile/store direction"
  :adr/topic "net-babiniku-uiux-redesign"
  :adr/status "accepted"
  :adr/authoritative true
  :adr/last_verified "2026-07-10"
  :adr/problem
  "{:source \"user direction 2026-07-10: 'net-babiniku を zeta ai と同じ uiux に。ただ babiniku は\n             kami engine で vrm 前提' -- redesign net-babiniku's UI/UX to match zeta-ai\n             (zeta-ai.io/en, Scatter Lab's AI-character chat app) while keeping babiniku's\n             own live kami-engine/WebGPU VRM avatar as the render substrate (not zeta's\n             static character art)\",\n   :followup_directions \"same session: also publish to iOS/Android under gftdcojp (both\n             Apple Developer Program and Google Play Console already contracted),\n             mobile technical approach Tauri 2 + cljs/re-frame/reagent (explicitly not\n             React Native), content policy 13+ / no adult content\",\n   :prior_state \"Milestones 0-4 (README.md): real containment (governor HARD/SOFT gate,\n             monetization/embodiment honest-default HARD-holds), real murakumo-backed LLM\n             chat, real live VRM avatars per roster character -- but rendered as a single\n             always-visible scroll (hero -> pricing -> every character's fully-expanded\n             card -> a collapsed audit-ledger section), no navigation, no discovery grid,\n             an engineering-dashboard shape rather than a consumer app's\",\n   :zeta_ai_ia_verified \"WebSearch + WebFetch of zeta-ai.io/en (Chrome extension was not\n             connected this session, so only structural/textual IA was confirmed, not\n             pixel-level color/font detail): top nav Home/Chat/Create/My Page + category-\n             pill filter bar; main content a character-card grid (portrait, follower\n             count, name, tagline, hashtag tags) -- a browse-then-chat IA\"}"
  :adr/decision
  "{:four_tab_ia {:what \"added :ui/route to app-db (:home/:chat/:create/:mypage), a\n            :ui/navigate event, a :ui/route sub, and a sticky top-nav\n            (babiniku.ui.views/nav-bar-view) matching zeta-ai's actual tab labels/order;\n            babiniku.ui.views/root switches on route instead of one long scroll\",\n            :scope \"presentation-only -- every gate (governor/review-turn,\n            monetization's honest-default HARD-hold, embodiment's Otete-only gate) is\n            dispatched through the exact same events as before, verified live via\n            headless-Chromium Playwright (a governor demo-button click from the new Chat\n            tab still produces a real :allowed ledger entry, now surfaced under My Page)\"},\n    :home_view \"zeta-style character grid (character-grid-card-view): avatar-monogram,\n            name, tagline, real derived tags (subscription tiers/giemon body/#created --\n            no fabricated genre data), real message count from :chat-transcripts.\n            Clicking a card calls the existing babiniku.stage/select-avatar! then\n            navigates to :chat\",\n    :chat_view \"the character on stage (babiniku.stage/selected), reuses\n            character-card-view UNCHANGED (transcript/input/demo buttons/tip-claim/edit-\n            export-delete all still present) -- a navigation change around an existing\n            component, not a rewrite. No character selected shows an honest empty state,\n            not a silent blank render\",\n    :create_view \"create-character-view, unchanged, as its own screen\",\n    :my_page_view \"character-card-view scoped to user-created characters only\n            (management controls the built-in four never had) plus\n            containment-section-view (the audit-ledger transparency section), moved here\n            from the bottom of the old single page\",\n    :avatar_monogram {:what \"deterministic HSL-colored circular initial per character-id\n            (avatar-color/avatar-monogram-view) instead of a fabricated portrait image\",\n            :why \"babiniku has no per-character portrait asset -- appearance only exists\n            as a live single-canvas WebGPU-rendered VRM avatar (one at a time); pre-\n            rendering N thumbnails or fetching every .vrm just for a grid was rejected as\n            disproportionate engineering for a UI/UX redesign task. A colored-initial\n            placeholder is honest (Slack/Discord-style fallback convention), not a claim\n            about appearance the app can't back up -- same honest-default principle as\n            the monetization/embodiment HARD-holds already in this codebase\"},\n    :stage_repositioning {:what \"CSS-only, keyed off a data-route attribute stamped on\n            <html> by babiniku.ui.views/root every render (a small, deliberate,\n            idempotent DOM side-effect). #stage-wrap/#stage-canvas remain exactly the DOM\n            nodes babiniku.web's WebGPU render loop already owns -- this ADR does not\n            touch that ownership or the render loop\", :effect \"stage hidden entirely on\n            Create/My Page (full-width single column, even on desktop); shrinks on\n            mobile-stacked Chat vs. Home\"},\n    :mobile_direction {:framework \"Tauri 2, wrapping the existing shadow-cljs/reagent/\n            re-frame/kami-webgpu build -- explicitly not React Native (would mean\n            abandoning the WebGPU render substrate shared with network-isekai)\",\n            :accounts \"both Apple Developer Program and Google Play Console already\n            contracted under gftdcojp (confirmed via user direction, not independently\n            verified by this agent -- store login/payment is out of this agent's\n            authority regardless)\",\n            :toolchain_confirmed \"Xcode 26.6, Rust 1.96 + tauri-cli 2.11.3, Android SDK +\n            Android Studio all present locally -- buildable, not tooling-blocked\",\n            :not_yet_built \"cargo tauri android/ios init scaffolding, on-device WebGPU\n            verification (iOS WKWebView / Android System WebView WebGPU support is\n            new/flag-gated and unverified for this app specifically -- the single\n            biggest technical risk), and store content-rating questionnaires\n            (interactive web forms, no general API -- to be drafted by this agent,\n            completed by the user) are follow-up work, not claimed done by this ADR\"},\n    :content_policy \"13+/Teen age rating, no adult content declared for store metadata --\n            already true of net-babiniku's app behavior (SFW-only LLM chat tier per\n            ADR-2607070800); this direction only fixes the store-listing answers, no\n            app-behavior change\"}"
  :adr/alternatives
  "[{:option \"a client-side routing library (reitit/bidi/hash routing)\" :rejected_because \"a single :ui/route keyword in app-db plus a case in root is the entire routing surface needed -- four fixed tabs, no deep-linkable per-character URLs requested; a routing library is unjustified weight\"} {:option \"pre-rendered PNG thumbnails per character (build-time headless-WebGPU capture)\" :rejected_because \"real engineering work (a render-to-texture build pipeline) disproportionate to a UI/UX redesign task -- left as a possible follow-up if the avatar-monogram placeholder proves insufficient\"} {:option \"React Native for mobile\" :rejected_because \"explicit user direction against it, and it would mean maintaining a second render stack instead of reusing kami-webgpu/cljs\"} {:option \"Capacitor instead of Tauri for mobile\" :rejected_because \"offered as the recommended default (AskUserQuestion) but rejected per explicit user direction specifying Tauri 2 + cljs/re-frame/reagent directly\"}]"
  :adr/consequences
  "{:gates_unchanged \"every existing nbb gate (governor/monetization/embodiment/character/\n            persona/roster-sync) and clojure -M:lint still pass unchanged -- this ADR\n            touched no domain .cljc namespace, only babiniku.ui.{db,events,subs,views}\n            and public/index.html\",\n    :verification \"nbb governor, nbb character, clojure -M:lint, npx shadow-cljs release app\n            (clean compile, only pre-existing warnings in babiniku.web/an external glb\n            lib, unrelated), and a headless-Chromium Playwright pass across all four tabs\n            (desktop + mobile viewport) with zero console errors -- confirmed the\n            governor demo button still produces a real ledger entry end-to-end through\n            the new nav\",\n    :behavior_change \"the old single-scroll page is fully replaced, not kept behind a\n            flag -- every feature moved, none removed, but this is a real UI change for\n            any returning visitor's muscle memory\",\n    :open_followup \"mobile (Tauri scaffold, on-device WebGPU verification, store listing/\n            rating questionnaires, actual submission) remains open -- this ADR does not\n            claim an iOS/Android build or store listing exists yet. A future ADR should\n            record the Tauri mobile shell's actual WebGPU verification result once built\n            -- the single biggest technical risk this ADR identifies but does not\n            resolve\",\n    :addendum_2026_07_10_same_day {:scaffold_done \"cargo tauri init/android init/ios init all\n            succeeded -- src-tauri/ generated (identifier cloud.gftd.babiniku), native\n            projects gen/android and gen/apple/app.xcodeproj both generated. Full\n            toolchain installed and confirmed: Android NDK 27, all 4 Android rust targets,\n            all 3 iOS rust targets, ios-deploy, iOS 26.5 Simulator runtime\",\n            :webgpu_verification_not_completed \"attempted but did NOT complete -- three\n            independent failures (iOS: simctl/CoreSimulator XPC calls hung indefinitely\n            after a simulator reported Booted; Android: emulator crash-looped on\n            'Failed to create window surface for DisplaySurfaceGl' and the process died\n            before boot completed, in both windowed and -no-window modes; even a plain\n            `cargo check --target aarch64-apple-ios-sim` stalled with rustc/sccache\n            child processes at 0% CPU) all traced to ONE root cause via `top`: extreme\n            host contention this session (Load Avg 141.76/320.77/459.08, ~90 stuck\n            processes system-wide) -- consistent with this repo's own documented\n            parallel-agent/fleet model running many concurrent sessions on the same\n            physical machine, not a defect in net-babiniku/Tauri/the scaffold\",\n            :conclusion \"do not treat the scaffold's existence as evidence the WebGPU\n            render path works inside a mobile WebView -- that is explicitly still\n            unverified and remains the single most important blocker before any app-store\n            submission work is worth starting. Re-attempt on a less-contended host, a\n            dedicated CI runner, or a real physical device (bypasses simulator/emulator\n            virtualization entirely)\"}}"
  :adr/authoritative_for
  ["net-babiniku's top-level navigation follows zeta-ai's Home/Chat/Create/My Page IA (babiniku.ui.views/nav-bar-view, :ui/route in app-db) rather than a single always-visible scroll"
   "a character grid on Home uses an honest avatar-monogram placeholder (deterministic color + initial), never a fabricated portrait, until/unless a real per-character thumbnail pipeline is separately decided"
   "stage (#stage-wrap/#stage-canvas) repositioning per tab is CSS-only via a data-route attribute -- babiniku.web's WebGPU render-loop ownership of those DOM nodes is never touched by routing changes"
   "net-babiniku's mobile distribution path is Tauri 2 wrapping the existing cljs/re-frame/reagent/kami-webgpu build, published to iOS/Android under gftdcojp -- not a React Native rewrite"
   "net-babiniku's store content rating is 13+/Teen, no adult content declared, consistent with its existing SFW-only chat tier"]
